[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2400.55, "timestamp": "00:40:00", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2408.71, "timestamp": "00:40:08", "text": "瞑想を本当に恐れるようになると思います。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2411.109, "timestamp": "00:40:11", "text": "一日中、夜中ずっとこの問題について考えます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2413.349, "timestamp": "00:40:13", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2417.27, "timestamp": "00:40:17", "text": "ええと、昨年のロサンゼルスの4月以降、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2418.87, "timestamp": "00:40:18", "text": "今は昨年2025年と呼ばれていると思いますが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2422.15, "timestamp": "00:40:22", "text": "4月と3月以降は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2425.43, "timestamp": "00:40:25", "text": "停電の問題はもうないと思います。   ああ、そうだ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2434.39, "timestamp": "00:40:34", "text": "家の中にいることに慣れすぎていて、毎回停電になることにも慣れすぎている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2437.43, "timestamp": "00:40:37", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2443.27, "timestamp": "00:40:43", "text": "ええ、2025年までに私たちはもっと強くなったと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2443.67, "timestamp": "00:40:43", "text": "ええ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2445.75, "timestamp": "00:40:45", "text": "いずれにせよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2452.069, "timestamp": "00:40:52", "text": "光が消えても構わない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2454.15, "timestamp": "00:40:54", "text": "けど気ああそうだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2454.79, "timestamp": "00:40:54", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2456.39, "timestamp": "00:40:56", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2459.43, "timestamp": "00:40:59", "text": "それもまた一つ。"}]